  "reference": false,
  "description": "Come as you are, splash as you will.\r\nWe believe in curiosity, playfulness, community, and the sacred art of holding hands while floating on your back.\r\n\r\nIf you’re tired of noisy certainty and ready for a gentler way, there’s a place for you here. Bring your burdens. Bring your questions. Bring a favorite stone, a smooth stream, and an open heart.\r\n\r\nOur values are simple:\r\n\r\n    Joy without apology\r\n    Fellowship without judgment\r\n    Mischief in moderation\r\n    Peace in deep water\r\n\r\nDip a paw in. Stay for the current.\r\nThe otters are waiting.",
